      "writtenOn": "2020-02-06T21:22:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is tp_delete task correct place to delete the UNI KPIs? Does this mean  if a service of subscriber is removed, then the  KPIs for UNI will be removed. Is that the case?",
      "revId": "435d5541dcc6a0624aa0dd880eaf38f9dc414a44",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
